<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1819905090"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:09.000"><div begin="7.497" end="38.490" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="7.497" end="14.181" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.497" end="8.038">言</span><span begin="8.038" end="8.859">不</span><span begin="8.859" end="9.333">由</span><span begin="9.333" end="9.901">衷</span> <span begin="11.405" end="11.902">言</span><span begin="11.902" end="12.763">不</span><span begin="12.763" end="13.165">由</span><span begin="13.165" end="14.181">衷</span></p><p begin="15.866" end="22.935" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.866" end="16.917">当唯美</span><span begin="16.917" end="17.330">的</span><span begin="17.330" end="17.720">祝</span><span begin="17.720" end="18.439">福</span> <span begin="18.596" end="18.889">都</span><span begin="18.889" end="19.837">不</span><span begin="19.837" end="20.307">能</span><span begin="20.501" end="21.558">阖上爱的</span><span begin="21.558" end="22.076">善</span><span begin="22.076" end="22.935">变</span></p><p begin="23.467" end="30.676" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.467" end="23.815">有</span><span begin="23.815" end="24.769">始</span><span begin="24.769" end="25.220">有</span><span begin="25.220" end="26.132">终</span> <span begin="27.302" end="28.159">只能有</span><span begin="28.159" end="28.828">始</span><span begin="28.828" end="29.204">有</span><span begin="29.204" end="30.676">终</span></p><p begin="31.836" end="38.490" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.836" end="32.302">容</span><span begin="32.302" end="32.758">我</span><span begin="32.758" end="33.087">为</span><span begin="33.087" end="34.120">我</span><span begin="34.120" end="34.613">们</span><span begin="34.613" end="35.479">写</span><span begin="35.996" end="36.357">一</span><span begin="36.357" end="37.058">篇</span><span begin="37.058" end="37.573">祷</span><span begin="37.573" end="38.490">文</span></p></div><div begin="39.394" end="1:16.630" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="39